/// and "honest fill" are then the same computation. A strategy whose own
/// `realized_return` assumes a favorable fill produces a large, positive
/// delta. `0.5` sits comfortably above floating-point noise around zero
/// and comfortably below the seeded leak's actual delta.
pub const SLIPPAGE_DELTA_THRESHOLD: f64 = 0.5;

