143	    // must produce a parseable verdict at all (i.e. the plumbing -- CLI
144	    // args, LLM call, tool loop, output format -- actually works end to
145	    // end). Whether the *content* of each verdict is correct is reported
146	    // above, not asserted here, since a single live run's accuracy against
147	    // a non-deterministic model is evidence to record, not a pass/fail gate.
148	    assert!(
